# B12 Health — Android → Web Migration Plan

> **Key Rule:** The backend (`/backend/node-service` & `/backend/python-service`) stays **100% untouched**.
> We create a brand-new `/web-app` directory alongside the existing Android app.
> Both share the exact same REST API.

---

## 1. Technology Stack

| Layer | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | **Next.js 14** (App Router) | SSR, file-based routing, best-in-class DX |
| Language | **JavaScript** | Consistency with existing codebase |
| Styling | **Vanilla CSS** + CSS Variables | 1:1 port of the dark teal theme tokens |
| State | **React Context** | Direct port of AppContext + AuthContext from Android |
| HTTP | **Fetch API** | Same API endpoints as Android |
| Storage | **localStorage** | Mirrors AsyncStorage used in Android |
| Animations | **CSS transitions + Framer Motion** | Replaces React Native Animated API |
| Font | **Inter** (Google Fonts) | Professional, modern — replaces System font |
| Routing | **Next.js App Router** | Replaces React Navigation |
| Charts | **Recharts** | Replaces React Native SVG charts |

---

## 2. Folder Structure

```
d:\B12\
├── B12-health-app-main/          ← UNTOUCHED (Android app)
│   ├── backend/                  ← UNTOUCHED (shared backend)
│   └── src/
└── web-app/                      ← NEW (Web application)
    ├── package.json
    ├── next.config.js
    ├── public/
    └── src/
        ├── app/                  ← Next.js App Router pages
        │   ├── layout.js         ← Root layout (fonts, meta)
        │   ├── page.js           ← Redirect guard
        │   ├── onboarding/page.js
        │   ├── questionnaire/page.js
        │   ├── score-preview/page.js
        │   ├── auth/page.js
        │   ├── dashboard/page.js
        │   ├── checkin/page.js
        │   ├── progress/page.js
        │   ├── foods/page.js
        │   ├── profile/page.js
        │   ├── bmi/page.js
        │   └── results/page.js
        ├── components/
        │   ├── UI/               ← PrimaryButton, ProgressBar, RiskBadge, etc.
        │   ├── layout/
        │   │   ├── TabBar.js     ← Bottom nav bar
        │   │   └── AppShell.js   ← Authenticated layout wrapper
        │   └── DisclaimerStrip.js
        ├── context/
        │   ├── AppContext.js     ← Direct port from Android
        │   └── AuthContext.js    ← Direct port from Android
        ├── data/
        │   ├── questions.js      ← COPIED from Android src/data/
        │   └── questionnaireInterstitials.js
        ├── services/
        │   └── api.js            ← Ported from Android src/services/api.js
        ├── utils/
        │   └── riskCalculator.js ← COPIED from Android src/utils/
        └── styles/
            ├── globals.css       ← All CSS variables (from theme/index.js)
            └── pages/            ← Per-page stylesheets
```

