## 4. Navigation Flow (Identical to Android)

```
App starts at /
  │
  ├─ isAuthenticated?   → /dashboard  (Main Tabs)
  ├─ riskResult exists? → /score-preview
  ├─ onboardingDone?    → /questionnaire
  └─ default            → /onboarding

/onboarding   (slides + profile form) → /questionnaire
/questionnaire → /results (auth) | /score-preview (guest)
/score-preview → /auth?mode=register
/auth          → /dashboard (on success)

Bottom Tab Bar (authenticated only):
  🏠 Home      → /dashboard
  📝 Check-in  → /checkin
  📊 Progress  → /progress
  🥗 Foods     → /foods
```

---

## 5. Screen-by-Screen Port Plan

### `/onboarding` ← OnboardingScreen.js
- **7 intro/feature slides** → CSS carousel with progress bar at top
- **Profile form** → Name (optional), Age range pills, Gender pills, Diet type cards
- State saved to `localStorage` via AppContext
- "Already have account?" → `/auth`

### `/auth` ← AuthScreen.js
- Login mode: Email + Password → `POST /api/auth/login`
- Register mode: Email + Password + Confirm → `POST /api/auth/register`
- Toggle between modes, contextual errors (duplicate email, wrong password, no account)
- Google Login button with "Coming Soon" badge
- JWT stored in `localStorage`

### `/questionnaire` ← QuestionnaireScreen.js
- One question at a time, animated fade/slide transition (CSS)
- Progress bar, category badge, options with emoji
- Interstitial insight cards every 3 questions
- Submit to `POST /api/questionnaire/submit`

### `/score-preview` ← ScorePreviewScreen.js
- Shows B12 risk level + percentage for guest users
- CTA → `/auth?mode=register`

### `/dashboard` ← DashboardScreen.js  *(Tab: Home)*
- Hero gradient header + greeting + streak pill + profile avatar
- Stat cards: Energy avg, Total Check-ins, B12 Score
- Today's check-in CTA (or "done" card)
- AI Insight card (server or fallback motivational)
- Risk result card → `/results`
- Quick access: BMI Calculator, History (coming soon)

### `/checkin` ← DailyCheckInScreen.js  *(Tab: Check-in)*
- 5 daily questions: Energy, Fatigue, Mood, Sleep, Dizziness
- Animated one-question-at-a-time flow
- Submit → `POST /api/checkin`
- Completion screen with streak display

### `/progress` ← WeeklyProgressScreen.js  *(Tab: Progress)*
- Weekly charts of energy, mood, fatigue (Recharts)
- Streak display, data from `GET /api/checkin/history`

### `/foods` ← B12FoodsScreen.js  *(Tab: Foods)*
- B12-rich foods list with category filter tabs
- Static data + filtering UI

### `/results` ← ResultsScreen.js
- Full B12 report: risk level + percentage + category breakdown
- Suggestions list, disclaimer

### `/profile` ← ProfileScreen.js
- User info (name, email, age, gender, diet type)
- Streak + total check-ins
- Logout → `POST /api/auth/logout` → redirect to `/auth`

### `/bmi` ← BMIScreen.js
- Height + Weight inputs, real-time BMI calculation
- BMI history from `GET /api/users/bmi`

---

## 6. API Integration (Unchanged Endpoints)

The web app calls the **exact same API routes** as Android:

```
POST /api/auth/register        POST /api/auth/login
POST /api/auth/logout

GET  /api/users/profile        PUT /api/users/profile
GET  /api/users/bmi            POST /api/users/bmi

GET  /api/questionnaire/questions
POST /api/questionnaire/submit

POST /api/checkin
GET  /api/checkin/history      GET /api/checkin/streak

GET  /api/insights
GET  /api/notifications
```

---

## 7. Android → Web Adaptation Table

| Android | Web |
|---|---|
| `React Navigation` | Next.js App Router |
| `Animated` API | CSS transitions + Framer Motion |
| `LinearGradient` | CSS `linear-gradient()` |
| `AsyncStorage` | `localStorage` |
| `SafeAreaView` | CSS `env(safe-area-inset-*)` |
| `Alert.alert()` | Custom Toast component |
| Bottom Tab Navigator | Fixed bottom nav bar (CSS) |
| React Native SVG charts | Recharts |
| `TouchableOpacity` | `<button>` with hover/active CSS |
| `ScrollView` | `overflow-y: auto` |

---

## 8. Files to Copy Directly (No Native Imports)

| Android Path | Web Path |
|---|---|
| `src/data/questions.js` | `src/data/questions.js` |
| `src/data/questionnaireInterstitials.js` | `src/data/questionnaireInterstitials.js` |
| `src/utils/riskCalculator.js` | `src/utils/riskCalculator.js` |

---

## 9. Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 — Foundation
1. Initialize Next.js 14 in `d:\B12\web-app\`
2. `globals.css` with all CSS variables (dark teal theme)
3. Reusable UI components (Button, ProgressBar, RiskBadge, InsightCard)
4. Port AppContext + AuthContext (localStorage persistence)
5. Port `api.js` service layer
6. Copy data + utils files

### Phase 2 — Auth Flow
7. `/onboarding` page (slides + profile form)
8. `/auth` page (login/register toggle)
9. Root route guard (redirect based on state)

### Phase 3 — Assessment Flow
10. `/questionnaire` page (animated Q&A + interstitials)
11. `/score-preview` page
12. `/results` page

### Phase 4 — Main App (Authenticated)
13. AppShell + bottom TabBar
14. `/dashboard` page
15. `/checkin` page
16. `/progress` page (Recharts)
17. `/foods` page

### Phase 5 — Profile, BMI & Polish
18. `/profile` page
19. `/bmi` page
20. Mobile-responsive CSS, micro-animations
21. Add web origin to backend `ALLOWED_ORIGINS`
22. End-to-end API testing

---

## 10. One Backend Change Needed

In `d:\B12\B12-health-app-main\backend\node-service\.env`, add:

```env
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3001,https://your-web-domain.com
```

> This is the **only** backend change. Everything else stays untouched.

